CC   -!- FUNCTION: Transcriptional repressor that down-regulates the
CC       expression of the fibrinogen gamma chain. Represses transcription
CC       of GSK3B gene promoter via its interaction with APBA1.
CC       {ECO:0000269|PubMed:20531236}.
CC   -!- SUBUNIT: Interacts with APBA1 (via PDZ 1 and 2 domains).
CC       {ECO:0000269|PubMed:20531236}.
